Description: target-local systemd effect process adapter for Agent Governor NG
 This package contains the feature-enabled, authority-neutral process adapter
 used for one exact Docket-custodied systemd attempt. It installs no service,
 configuration, authority state, target definition, or mutable store and does
 not start, stop, enable, disable, or restart any unit.
